### Projects - Atualizar projeto inexistente - deve retornar 404 Not Found
PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/projects/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Projeto inexistente",
  "description": null,
  "dueDate": null
}


### Projects - Atualizar com nome vazio - deve retornar 400 Bad Request
PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/projects/{{projetoTenantAdminPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "description": "Esta alteração não deve ser persistida.",
  "dueDate": null
